{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Congratulations on your new position at the town Hall. The Mayor and her colleagues are very pleased to meet you. They hope you are ready for puzzles and challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598480/extras/GIF_demo_EN.gif?t=1745920211\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Mayor's secretary Escape Game&quot; is an escape game for virtual reality (VR) and PC (non-VR). Solve the puzzles, search the rooms, investigate the places and, if you wish, live the story and its implications fully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598480/extras/GIF_multi_EN.gif?t=1745920211\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">   \u25a0  A demo with the first room of the complete game with puzzles to solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0  Fun mechanics and interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0  Multiplayer up to 4 players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">   \u25a0  An immersive story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0  Save system to take breaks during the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0  Hint system to get help if needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598480/extras/Gif_puzzles_en.gif?t=1745920211\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>VR and non VR:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For the game in VR, the game supports full room-scale/standing tracking on both the HTC Vive and Oculus Rift with SteamVR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For the game in non-VR, the gameplay has been designed so the players on 